m/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T17:24:25Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T17:24:25Z","body":"For the record, I think that part of what https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10910 was trying to address was that the \"Quick Load...\" and \"Load...\" entries in the popup menu are too far away and at unpredictable positions, since they're at the end of a dynamically sized popup.\r\n\r\nI made a test moving them to the top in https://github.com/akien-mga/godot/tree/editorresourcepicker-load-first\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4569b611-36b4-4db0-8023-5cbffafaff3a)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/600e72d8-00bc-46c2-88fc-8ea93ed0db24)\r\n\r\nThis might be a good improvement to try for 4.5, but it looks a bit weird to have load options separated from save/edit/clear/etc. while they're semantically related. And bringing all the save/edit/clear/etc. stuff to the top too would likely send the also very useful \"New [Type]\" entries too far down. We brainstormed some ideas for this with @RPicster, I'll try to open a new proposal (discussion, as it's not fully thought out) to evaluate some ideas alongside seeing how to bring back https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10910.","author_association":"MEMBER","r